Subject: [PATCH 01/63] [DEMO CODE ONLY] changes to cuttlefish configuration

Summary:
Remove linux_musl from boar configuration.
Changes to Android.bp to enable Mac Os build.
This is a part of D77880815.

Test Plan:
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k &> ~/build.logs.txt

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: achong, tcare, benthomas

Reviewed By: achong

Subscribers: ryanyu

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D79660900

Tags: aarch64
